{"u": "10777208002", "name": "Gorilla Game [New Map]", "place": "139149758386258", "created": "2026-11-16", "updated": "2026-11-28T17:55:33.492Z", "genre": "Survival", "subgenre": "1 vs All", "desc": "❕LIKE THE GAME FOR MORE UPDATES❕\nGorilla game is a scary horror survival game set in the dark Backrooms. One player is the monster. Everyone else is a gilla trying to escape the lab experiment until time runs out. Gorilla Tag fans, welcome.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\nVote for a map in the lobby. The monster is random, and your odds rise each game you aren't picked. Gillas get a head start, then the monster is released. If it catches you, it tears you apart. Sometimes all gillas glow through walls.\n\nCONTROLS\nMove: WASD or stick. Jump: Space or A.\nRun into a wall to climb, jump at ledges to vault, jump off walls to wall jump.\nMonster: run into a gilla to grab it, click/tap to rip off a limb. Right-click, Q or B lets go.\nPC, mobile, console, VR.\n\nLOBBY\nHat Shop: buy hats with Robux, yours for good.\nGilla Lab: change color and hats.\nIncrease Chance: be the monster more.\nPay to Join: join a hunt in progress.\n\nTags: Horror, Scary, Monster, Lab, Backrooms, Experiment, Survival, Escape, Gorilla Tag, Gila\n", "desc_hash": "8e44f84e588f", "max_players": 14, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 1738708, "favorites": 73378, "creator": {"id": 7325337, "name": "The Boba Kingdom", "type": "Group", "verified": false}, "daily": {"2026-11-28": {"updated": "2026-11-28T17:55:33.492Z", "visits": 1738708, "fav": 73378, "up": 1646, "down": 456}}, "passes": [{"name": "Pool Lurker Monster", "price": 299}, {"name": "x2 Monster Chance", "price": 600}, {"name": "Shark Monster", "price": 299}, {"name": "VIP", "price": 200}, {"name": "x2 Votes", "price": 150}, {"name": "x2 Bananas", "price": 249}], "products": [{"name": "Increase Chance", "price": 25}, {"name": "Top Hat", "price": 40}, {"name": "Cool Shades", "price": 50}, {"name": "Rice Farmer Hat", "price": 50}, {"n